        "camera": "push-in",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#10243a",
          "dim": 0.3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "सुबह घर से दफ़्तर। शाम को दफ़्तर से घर।",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Rajesh walking the same road morning and evening, the city sliding past.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "road",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "RAJAT",
              "mood": "tired",
              "action": "walk"
            }
          ],
          "fog": 0.2,
          "dust": false,
          "view": "wide"
        },
        "camera": "drift",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#13304a",
          "dim": 0.3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "वही कुर्सी, वही स्क्रीन, वही मीटिंग।",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Rajesh at his desk under cold office light.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "office",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "RAJAT",
              "mood": "tired",
              "action": "idle"
            }
          ],
          "props": [
            {
              "id": "screen"
            }
          ],
          "fog": 0.15,
          "dust": true,
          "view": "wide"
        },
        "camera": "pan-right",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#0e2a33",
          "dim": 0.3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "हर शुक्रवार वह सोचता, अगले हफ़्ते से सब बदल दूँगा।",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Rajesh looks up, hoping, a calendar beside him.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "office",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "RAJAT",
              "mood": "calm",
              "action": "lookup"
            }
          ],
          "props": [
            {
              "id": "calendar"
            }
          ],
          "fog": 0.15,
          "dust": true,
          "view": "wide"
        },
        "camera": "tilt-up",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#0e2a33",
          "dim": 0.25
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "लेकिन अगला हफ़्ता भी बिल्कुल पिछले जैसा निकलता।",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "A calendar where every day is crossed off the same way.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "home",
          "props": [
            {
              "id": "calendar"
            }
          ],
          "fog": 0.3,
          "dust": true,
          "view": "wide"
        },
        "camera": "push-in",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#1a1410",
          "dim": 0.4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "एक रात वह खिड़की पर खड़ा रहा। नीचे वही सड़क थी, जिस पर वह रोज़ भागता था।",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Rajesh at the window at night, looking down at the street he runs along every day.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "home",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "RAJAT",
              "mood": "sad",
              "action": "lookup",
              "shadow": 0.45
            }
          ],
          "fog": 0.3,
          "dust": true,
          "view": "wide"
        },
        "camera": "pan-left",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#0c1a2e",
          "dim": 0.4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "उसने खुद से पूछा, क्या मैं ज़िंदा हूँ, या बस चल रहा हूँ?",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Close on Rajesh's face. The question he never asked.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "home",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "RAJAT",
              "mood": "sad",
              "action": "idle",
              "shadow": 0.35
            }
          ],
          "fog": 0.3,
          "dust": true,
          "view": "close"
        },
        "camera": "push-in",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#0c1a2e",
          "dim": 0.35
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "अगली सुबह उसने इस्तीफ़ा लिखा। हाथ काँप रहे थे, पर इरादा पक्का था।",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "A resignation letter being signed on a desk.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "office",
          "props": [
            {
              "id": "letter"
            }
          ],
          "fog": 0.2,
          "dust": true,
          "view": "wide"
        },
        "camera": "pull-out",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#12303a",
          "dim": 0.25
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "बॉस ने पूछा, पैसे कहाँ से आएँगे? राजेश मुस्कुराया, पता नहीं, पर रास्ता मेरा होगा।",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Rajesh and his stern boss face to face in the office; Rajesh stands steady.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "office",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "RAJAT",
              "mood": "resolute",
              "action": "nod"
            },
            {
              "id": "VIKRAM",
              "mood": "stern",
              "action": "idle"
            }
          ],
          "fog": 0.15,
          "dust": true,
          "view": "wide"
        },
        "camera": "drift",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#12303a",
          "dim": 0.2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "उस शाम वह घर नहीं गया। वह एक ऐसे रास्ते पर चला, जहाँ उसने कभी कदम नहीं रखा था।",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Rajesh walks toward the sunrise on a road he has never taken.",
        "file": null,
        "source": "react-art",
        "art": {
          "location": "dawn",
